--- !u!114 &-8014375369093902613
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 12
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: ED_V.1/12
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "No tengo nada m\xE1s que decirle, Abraham./n\xBFHar\xE1 usted justicia?/nEl
    pueblo reclama que alguien pague por este atroz acto./nMe pregunto a qui\xE9n
    escoger\xE1."
  childrenIDs: []
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2565
    y: 121
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 8288426215254106694, guid: a1347a34fee077c46bb4de37f94af7b4, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &-6784573747032316508
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: ED_V.1/1
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Ya est\xE1 anocheciendo, Abraham./n\xBFSabe ya qui\xE9n es el culpable de
    la tragedia del ni\xF1o?"
  childrenIDs:
  - ED_V.1/2
  - ED_V.1/3
  - 2
  - 3
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 0
    y: 0
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 8288426215254106694, guid: a1347a34fee077c46bb4de37f94af7b4, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &-4270820596399405758
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 11
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: ED_V.1/11
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "El amuleto tiene voluntad propia./nDesea cargarse, as\xED que incita a las
    personas a pon\xE9rselo y as\xED arrebatarles la vida./nRequiere una voluntad
    muy fuerte para deshacerse de su influencia./nA menudo, requiere ayuda externa
    para quit\xE1rselo."
  childrenIDs:
  - ED_V.1/12
  - 12
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 2194
    y: 119
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 8288426215254106694, guid: a1347a34fee077c46bb4de37f94af7b4, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &-2743117271843856823
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 6
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: ED_V.1/6
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Me interesa, Abraham./nY por ello, quiero ayudarle./nMe hospedo en la posada
    Garrido./nAll\xED, se hospedaba la mujer que llevaba el colgante maldito en su
    cuello./nLo reconoc\xED al instante./nY s\xE9 qu\xE9 le sucedi\xF3 al chico."
  childrenIDs:
  - ED_V.1/7
  - ED_V.1/8
  - 7
  - 8
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1098
    y: 135
    width: 300
    height: 200
